      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking at expanding our component sourcing for next year. we're weighing up some options between suppliers in vietnam and nigeria. from a logistics and business culture standpoint, how do they compare in terms of general reliability and ease of doing business? just need a quick rundown of the pros and cons for each region.",
